flowchart TB
    IN[Incoming Support Ticket] --> F[Classification Facade]
    F --> MODE{Mode / Feature Flag}
    MODE -->|Legacy| L[Legacy Classifier]
    MODE -->|Canary| G[LLM Gateway]
    G -->|Circuit closed| P[LLM Provider]
    P --> V{JSON Schema + Acceptance Policy}
    V -->|Accepted| S[Selected Classification]
    G -.->|Timeout / Circuit open| FB[Legacy Fallback]
    V -.->|Invalid / Rejected| FB
    FB --> L
    L --> S
    S --> A[Monolith Persists and Routes Ticket]
    F -.->|Asynchronous shadow event| Q[Shadow Evaluation Queue]
    Q -.-> W[Shadow Worker / Separate LLM Request]
    W -.-> E[Store Output Only]
    E -.-> C[Compare with Labeled Reference Data]
    classDef production fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#1e3a8a
    classDef legacy fill:#f3f4f6,stroke:#6b7280,color:#111827
    classDef shadow fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d
    classDef validation fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f
    classDef fallback fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#7f1d1d
    class F,MODE,G,P,S,A,IN production
    class L legacy
    class Q,W,E,C shadow
    class V validation
    class FB fallback
